  "interpretation": "Reply-search improves the transparent search baseline on fresh independent maps, including against plain beam search with a larger nominal transition budget. Increasing plain beam search from 256 to 1024 nodes alone did not pass the independent-map gate. Reply searches incur separate rollout overhead, so these are not matched wall-time comparisons. On a separate fresh 256-map all-seat gate, reply-search decisively beat routed-v6 and is a validated stronger teacher for this specific procedural duel setup. This is not a global Elo rating or evidence that a student already inherited the advantage."
